; Regression test for GitHub issue #3314: balanced virtual postings, in
; [brackets], must balance to zero as strictly as real postings must.
; EUR appears here only in costs, so it has no display precision of its
; own, and the 0.01 EUR left over would round away to nothing; the check
; widens EUR to the precision of the costs (#1114) for these postings as
; it does for real ones.  The remainder still prints at EUR's precision.

2015/03/05 * Payee
    [Budget:Bank]                              $1.00 @  1.02 EUR
    [Budget:Revenue]                          -$1.00 @  1.01 EUR

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 10:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 8-10:
> 2015/03/05 * Payee
>     [Budget:Bank]                              $1.00 @  1.02 EUR
>     [Budget:Revenue]                          -$1.00 @  1.01 EUR
Unbalanced remainder of balanced virtual postings is:
                   0
Amount to balance against:
             EUR1.02
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
